# Pairs with TypeOK in WalMove. The fence is raised without consulting the move
# budget, so moves are started past MaxMoves and the counter leaves its domain;
# only the well-typedness check reports it.
MODULE: WalMoveTypeOkMoveCountRunaway
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a move is started without consulting the move budget
PERTURBS: MoveFence

--- FIND
    /\ move = "idle"
    /\ moves < MaxMoves
    /\ move' = "fenced"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the move budget is not consulted.
    /\ move = "idle"
    /\ move' = "fenced"
--- END